recommend keep-going — the position/value rearrangement trio is complete; the next Lotus crux stays exact and structural: a per-region reverse or invert over an ALES23 selection (compose the proven edit with the proven span), or a swap-halves (a named rotate by len/2); each its own self-approved round, no custody gate reached.
